[0.000, "o", "\u001b[34m\u001b[47mD O P E W A R S\u001b[30m\u001b[47m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2d\u001b[K\u001b[3;13H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "Based on John E. Dell's old Drug Wars game, dopewars is a simulation of an\u001b[K\u001b[4;14H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "imaginary drug market.  dopewars is an All-American game which features\u001b[K\u001b[5;25H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "buying, selling, and trying to get past the cops!\u001b[K\r\u001b[6d\u001b[K\u001b[7;12H\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "The first thing you need to do is pay off your debt to the Loan Shark. After\u001b[K\u001b[8;15H\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "that, your goal is to make as much money as possible (and stay alive)!\u001b[K\u001b[9;23H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "You have one month of game time to make your fortune.\u001b[K\r\u001b[10d\u001b[K\u001b[11;11H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "Version 1.6.2+20260114 Copyright (C) 1998-2022  Ben Webb benwebb@users.sf.net\u001b[K\u001b[12;21H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1K "]
[0.000, "o", "dopewars is released under the GNU General Public License\u001b[K\r\u001b[13d\u001b[K\u001b[14;7H\u001b[1K "]
